WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
Today is the day before your procedure and this is the most important day of

2
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:05.040
your prep so let's

3
00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:10.160
make it count. Starting today you must drink clear liquids only which includes

4
00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:10.720
water,

5
00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:16.300
broth, plain tea, black coffee, clear juices and plain gelatin. Stay well hydrated

6
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:16.960
throughout

7
00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:22.240
the day and remember no solid foods, no alcohol and no dairy. Avoid anything

8
00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:23.520
red, purple, blue or

9
00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:28.670
orange as these dyes can be mistaken for blood during the procedure. Begin your

10
00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:29.840
bowel prep

11
00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:34.060
exactly when your prep instruction sheet says to don't skip ahead or delay. If

12
00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:35.520
you're on a split

13
00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:39.370
dose schedule your second dose will be taken the morning of your procedure.

14
00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:40.560
Your instruction sheet

15
00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:44.850
will have the exact timing for that. One important note about your ride

16
00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:46.320
tomorrow, rideshares and

17
00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:51.110
taxis are fine for getting you to your procedure. But after your procedure you

18
00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:52.400
may only use a rideshare

19
00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:57.970
or taxi if a companion who is 18 or older is in the car with you. Going

20
00:00:57.970 --> 00:00:59.280
home alone in a rideshare

21
00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:03.840
or taxi is not permitted. Please make sure you have that arranged in

22
00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:05.920
advance. You're almost there

23
00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:06.880
stick with it.
